# Text files are checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows puts CRLF into the working
# copy, and a one-liner copied out of a local README breaks: the carriage
# return lands on the last word of the line.
#
# The Windows build is unaffected, MSVC reads LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must not be touched.
bin/* binary
*.exe binary
